    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804748cf8b85efee0b7140b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──无声铃鹿。她总是一起跑便冲出重围，\n中期仍一路领先，直到最后\n都维持领先抵达终点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd19e2ae19351c3ebfc71442d4f3f146bda414548559de0f6c584c6d9696b0a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:930be6c1d4aefa8365995598",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丝毫无法趁虚而入。完美的理想跑法，\n原本不可能实现的，梦想中的跑法。\n如今由她亲身实现了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3954678b78d2ea860e53499fd92442f2f95228a1e81d02dc05fff78dd1b58878",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc7ccaaf5ae6ddcb6f601889",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若想赢过她，必须在比赛中抓准最适宜的局面，\n然后超越她那惊人的速度。\n究竟何时才是最好的时机？",
      "source_fingerprint": "46d7f2d8de1292c620e22b9432edcec0310e5aa924f055bb3c8c06ed990ac1ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf5d62f118aff145452d3387",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是长距离还有希望，但中距离比赛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "26d56a72dad01b6b3905a132239dc896420071f98bd60459c246e652aeb47a8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
