    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dff995378021beb7733afa08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我希望你能享用到\n如此特别的巧克力～\n滋味一定会令人永难忘怀的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70c40eeb48662ef2f68fd406e26b593053cc06eeda1c41c9d115e1693523423c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
