    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec1d9b6abd035afe0f1440d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在到处都买得到美味的巧克力。\n但是，用这棵树的可可豆\n做成的巧克力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "28baba9205d8e2bd2003f6c2f50f6292d9f00859a142f41c43bdc6eb663d38c0",
