      "uid": "zhcn:4cbd3f5455181da2dfe00b0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一定有着无法取代的滋味吧。\n看来目白光明真正想送我的礼物，\n就是这种珍贵的体验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af5bf783ffad419dcab855ee359a80d335773842fc8fe9fdc8376ad3a6356587",
